    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yakhuluma loMose emva kokufa kwamadodana amabili kaAroni afa ekusondeleni eNkosini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yathi kuMose: Mtshele uAroni umfowenu ukuba angangeni njalo endaweni engcwele engaphakathi kweveli, phambi kwesihlalo somusa esiphezu komtshokotsho, ukuba angafi; ngoba ngizakubonakala eyezini phezu kwesihlalo somusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 6:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uAroni kangene endaweni engcwele elenkunzi yomnikelo wesono, elenqama yomnikelo wokutshiswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embathe ibhatshi elingcwele elenziwe ngelembu elihle, lebhulugwe elenziwe ngelembu elihle emzimbeni wakhe, azibophe ngebhanti elenziwe ngelembu elihle, athwale iqhiye eyenziwe ngelembu elihle; lezi yizambatho ezingcwele. Ageze umzimba wakhe ngamanzi, azembathe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athathe ebandleni labantu bakoIsrayeli impongo ezimbili zibe ngumnikelo wesono, lenqama ibe ngumnikelo wokutshiswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni kazinikelele ngenkunzi ibe ngumnikelo wesono, azenzele lendlu yakhe indlela yokubuyisana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athathe impongo ezimbili, azibeke phambi kweNkosi ngasemnyango wethente lokuhlangana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enze inkatho ngezimpongo ezimbili, enye inkatho ibe ngeyeNkosi lenye ibe ngekaAzazeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni kanikele ngempongo edliwe yinkatho yeNkosi, ibe ngumnikelo wesono; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa impongo edliwe yinkatho kaAzazeli kayibekwe phambi kweNkosi iphilile ukuba kwenziwe indlela yokubuyisana ngayo, ithunyelwe kuAzazeli enkangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni kazinikelele ngenkunzi ibe ngumnikelo wesono, azenzele yena lendlu yakhe indlela yokubuyisana; kahlabe inkunzi ibe ngumnikelo ngenxa yesono sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agcwalise umganu wokutshisela impepha ngamalahle omlilo asealtareni phambi kweNkosi, agcwalise lezandla zakhe ngempepha elephunga elimnandi icholisisiweyo, akulethe ngaphakathi kweveli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeke impepha phezu komlilo phambi kweNkosi, ukuze iyezi lempepha lisibekele isihlalo somusa esiphezu kobufakazi, ukuba angafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athathe igazi lenkunzi, afafaze ngalo isihlalo somusa ngasempumalanga ngomunwe wakhe; langaphambi kwesihlalo somusa afafaze ngegazi kasikhombisa ngomunwe wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abesehlaba impongo engumnikelo wesono ozanikelelwa abantu, alethe igazi layo ngaphakathi kweveli, enze ngegazi layo njengokwenza kwakho ngegazi lenkunzi, afafaze ngalo isihlalo somusa langaphambi kwesihlalo somusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho uzakwenzela indawo engcwele indlela yokubuyisana, ngenxa yokungcola kwabantu bakoIsrayeli, langenxa yeziphambeko zabo, lezono zabo zonke. Futhi uzakulenzela njalo ithente lokuhlangana, elihlala labo liphakathi kokungcola kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakungabi khona umuntu ethenteni lokuhlangana, kusukela ekungeneni kwakhe endaweni engcwele ukwenza indlela yokubuyisana aze aphume. Nxa esenzele yena indlela yokubuyisana, lendlu yakhe, lebandla lonke labakoIsrayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uzakuphumela ealtareni eliphambi kweNkosi, alenzele lalo indlela yokubuyisana, athathe igazi lenkunzi legazi lempongo, alininde empondweni zealtare inxa zonke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afafaze ialtare ngegazi kasikhombisa ngomunwe wakhe, alihlambulule, alenze libe ngcwele ekungcoleni kwabantu bakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho eseqedile ukwenzela indawo engcwele indlela yokubuyisana, lethente lokuhlangana, lealtare, uzanikela ngempongo ephilayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uAroni abeke izandla zakhe enhlokweni yempongo ephilayo, avume bonke ububi babantu bakoIsrayeli, leziphambeko zabo, lezono zabo zonke, azibeke enhlokweni yempongo, ayithumele ngomuntu olungiselwe lokho, iye enkangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impongo izakuthwala bonke ububi babo, iye endaweni elugwadule; izakuyekelwa ukuba izihambele enkangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni uzakungena ethenteni lokuhlangana, akhumule izambatho zelembu elihle azembethe ekungeneni kwakhe endaweni engcwele, azitshiye khona,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.44.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hez 44:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ageze umzimba wakhe ngamanzi endaweni engcwele, agqoke izambatho zakhe, aphume, anikele umnikelo wakhe wokutshiswa lomnikelo wokutshiswa wabantu, azenzele yena labantu indlela yokubuyisana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamahwahwa omnikelo wesono uzakuwatshisa ealtareni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowo osa impongo kuAzazeli uzakugezisa ingubo zakhe, ageze umzimba wakhe ngamanzi, andubana angene ezihonqweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkunzi yomnikelo wezono lempongo yomnikelo wesono, elangeniswa igazi lazo ukwenza indlela yokubuyisana endaweni engcwele, zizakhutshelwa ngaphandle kwezihonqo; izikhumba zazo, lenyama yazo, lomswane wazo kutshiswe ngomlilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
