              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kuzakuba yisimiso esingelakuphela kini sokuthi ngosuku lwetshumi lwenyanga yesikhombisa lizakuzithoba, lingasebenzi, owokuzalwa elizweni lowemzini ohlala phakathi kwenu.",
          "type": "text",
